--- !u!114 &8611013492376917243
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 7187719109279447997}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0f5a8379bd13ddf43b46cff2baab67e9, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  AllHeadlines:
  - headlineText: 'Main Headline : Big Names Arrived!'
    headlineDescription: "Two big name factions have landed to A\u2019ea.  Marcel
      Trading Company arrived with five ships worth of personel and resources to
      scout the island for their resources. Meanwhile, in our humble town of Wavecrest,
      Chemy, a representative of the Alchemist Association has arrived to stay with
      us to learn more about our local flora and fauna. Lets give them a warm welcome
      and show the hospitality of the people of A\u2019ea."
    headlineImage: {fileID: 0}
    requirementsToBeShown:
      requirements:
      - rid: 1115517454946664451
  - headlineText: 'Main Headline: Marcel Trading Company Opening Up Outpost'
    headlineDescription: "After the scouting process concluded yesterday, Marcel
      Trading Company decides to stay in A\u2019ea decides to stay in A\u2019ea for
      a while. They plan to open up outpost across the island to extract the resources
      and commercialize them globally. Marcel Trading Company promises to promote
      our island to increase trade in return for allowing them to gather resources
      from our island. This endeavor might finally put our island on the map."
    headlineImage: {fileID: 0}
    requirementsToBeShown:
      requirements:
      - rid: 1115517454946664452
  - headlineText: 'Main Headline: New Mayor Elected in Frostshine'
    headlineDescription: 'Mr. White, a representative of Marcel Trading Company was
      elected as the new mayor for the frosty town of Frostshine. After occupying
      the town, Marcel Trading Company managed to provide heating alternatives for
      the citizen of Frostshine. Thanks to their industrialized heater, citizens
      of Frostshine no longer need to worry about preserving fuel to keep warm throughout
      the year. '
    headlineImage: {fileID: 0}
    requirementsToBeShown:
      requirements:
      - rid: 1115517474069282832
  - headlineText: 'Main Headline: Winterfest is Drawing Near'
    headlineDescription: As summer is reaching its end comes time to reflect on all
      that happened within this season and look forward to the festivities of winter.
      This Summer, many new faces have been welcomed into our lovely island. For
      this Winterfest, the island plans to go all out to celebrate their new guests.
      We hope everyone is excited to celebrate the festivities with family and friends.
    headlineImage: {fileID: 0}
    requirementsToBeShown:
      requirements:
      - rid: 1115517474069282833
  - headlineText: 'Main Headline: Peaceful Times'
    headlineDescription: "Another quiet day has passed on A\u2019ea. The people of
      Wavecrest continue their daily lives, and all remains peaceful across the island.
      There are no major happenings to report today, so we wish everyone a safe and
      pleasant day until the next edition of the paper.\r"
    headlineImage: {fileID: 0}
    requirementsToBeShown:
      requirements:
      - rid: 1115517554788139031
  AllLocalRequests:
  - requestText: 'Local Request: Farm Boy Kenneth'
    requestDescription: "Due to his brothers being currently out of town to buy supplies
      for the farm, Kenneth doesn\u2019t have enough time to complete his daily chores
      on the farm. Help him by creating a @Swift potion."
    requestImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4638114a12e868c46af3e9f51d3ce539, type: 3}
    questData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2cc601d7eb1a0d34482f68c1aee0b8ad, type: 2}
    followUpNewsId: local_kenneth_swiftpotion
    requirementsToBeShown:
