  - requestText: 'Local Request: Bookworm Violette'
    requestDescription: Bookworm Violette has trouble sleeping at night due to always
      thinking about the next book she wants to read. This make her feel tired everyday
      and reduces her enjoyment when reading books. Make her a Sleep Potion to help
      her sleep at night.
    requestImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e3f49ef8e09df5349b6b2165575c2b74, type: 3}
