  - requestText: 'Local Request: Old Man Sven'
    requestDescription: After countless of time losing his lucky spoon, Old Man Sven
      thinks he just has very bad luck. He wonders if the new alchemist in town has
      a solution to prevent him from losing his lucky spoon again. Make a Luck Potion
      for him to negate his bad luck. It is said that a herb that is connected to
      luck grows near the lighthouse.
