  - newsId: local_sven_spoon
    newsText: 'Local News: Old Man Sven Found His Lucky Spoon, Again!'
    newsDescription: "After losing his lucky spoon for 4 days, Post Girl Poshe found
      it inside the fountain in town square while trying to retrieve her hat. We
      still don\u2019t know how it got there but lets hope Old Man Sven won\u2019t
      lose it again."
    newsImage: {fileID: 0}
    willBeShown: 1
    hasBeenShown: 0
    canAlwaysShow: 0
  - newsId: peace
    newsText: 'Local News: Peaceful Days'
    newsDescription: "Life carries on peacefully in Wavecrest, with friendly faces
      filling the streets and warm smiles shared between neighbors. The town has
      enjoyed another quiet day, with everyone tending to their daily routines and
      lending a helping hand where needed. We are happy to report that all remains
      well, and we hope the days ahead continue to bring the same peace and cheer
      to our beloved town.\r"
    newsImage: {fileID: 0}
    willBeShown: 1
    hasBeenShown: 0
    canAlwaysShow: 1
  - newsId: quest_violette_sleeppotion
    newsText: 'Local News: Mr. Tidus Welcomes a New Member to His Family'
    newsDescription: "We welcome Mr. Tidus' newest stead, John Smith into the Smith
      Family. John Smith is a black horse that was gifted to Mr. Tidus by the new
      mayor of Frostshine, Mr. White. If you see a big black horse wondering around
      town, don\u2019t forget to say hi!"
    newsImage: {fileID: 0}
    willBeShown: 0
    hasBeenShown: 0
    canAlwaysShow: 0
